--TEST--
A destructuring variable already declared with the same type, or written twice in one pattern, is `E0406` at the second one, at the top level and in a method
--FILE--
<?nvs
array<int> $pair = [1, 2];
int $first = 0;
[int $first, int $second] = $pair;
[int $left, int $left] = $pair;

class Pairs {
    public static function split(array<int> $pair): int {
        int $a = 0;
        [int $a, int $b] = $pair;
        return $a + $b;
    }
}

echo "unreachable\n";
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0406]: `$first` is already declared
  --> case.nvs:3:5
%A
error[E0406]: `$left` is already declared
  --> case.nvs:5:6
%A
error[E0406]: `$a` is already declared
   --> case.nvs:9:13
%A
error: aborting due to 3 errors
To read what a code means and how to fix it, run `nvs agent show <code>`.
